    "title": "Make It Haverhill Makes it Happen in New Downtown Space - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Tim Coco ,\n1 hours ago Make It Haverhill, which has evolved since its 2017 founding in Haverhill’s Mount Washington neighborhood has settled into its new downtown home. Begun as a nonprofit by Keith F. Boucher in the long-gone Benedetti Shoe Store on Washington Street, the organization is now part of Community Action and just relocated to 59 Orchard St., in a recently renovated 1940-era retail space. Make It Haverhill matches residents to careers and provides related training, Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
